/**
 * Hangeul Valley – Thematic Economy Edition
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * Core loop:
 *  Plant words → Crops ripen → Harvest → Earn coins → Buy a new level pack
 * Players choose their own learning path instead of being forced into automatic progression.
 */

// ═══════════════ GLOBAL STATE ════════════════════════════════════════════════
